### Get my professional profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pro/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create professional service
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pro/services
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 1,
  "name": "Women's Haircut",
  "description": "Professional haircut and styling",
  "durationMinutes": 60,
  "priceType": "FIXED",
  "price": "150",
  "active": true
}

### Submit profile for verification
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pro/profile/submit-verification
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get pending professionals
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/professionals/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Approve professional
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/professionals/01a0c7ea-0ab7-7b59-8920-40b39bbc6b87/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Reject professional
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/professionals/01a0c7ea-0ab7-7b59-8920-40b39bbc6b87/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Public: list professionals
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/professionals

### Public: view Ayna Beauty profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/professionals/01a0c7ea-0ab7-7b59-8920-40b39bbc6b87

### Public: view Ayna Beauty services
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/professionals/01a0c7ea-0ab7-7b59-8920-40b39bbc6b87/services

### Create portfolio item
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pro/portfolio
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/portfolio/haircut-1.jpg",
  "serviceId": "01a0c82b-8334-7dc0-94f9-88243750e07e",
  "title": "Elegant Haircut",
  "description": "Classic haircut and styling",
  "featured": true,
  "active": true
}

### Set working hours
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pro/working-hours
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "dayOfWeek": 1,
      "startTime": "09:00",
      "endTime": "18:00"
    },
    {
      "dayOfWeek": 2,
      "startTime": "09:00",
      "endTime": "18:00"
    },
    {
      "dayOfWeek": 3,
      "startTime": "09:00",
      "endTime": "18:00"
    },
    {
      "dayOfWeek": 4,
      "startTime": "09:00",
      "endTime": "18:00"
    },
    {
      "dayOfWeek": 5,
      "startTime": "09:00",
      "endTime": "18:00"
    }
  ]
}

### Create blocked availability exception
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pro/availability-exceptions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startsAt": "2026-09-25T13:00:00+05:00",
  "endsAt": "2026-09-25T15:00:00+05:00",
  "type": "BLOCKED",
  "note": "Personal appointment"
}

### Public: Ayna Beauty portfolio
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/professionals/01a0c7ea-0ab7-7b59-8920-40b39bbc6b87/portfolio

### Public: Ayna Beauty availability
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/professionals/01a0c7ea-0ab7-7b59-8920-40b39bbc6b87/availability

### Create booking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serviceId": "01a0c82b-8334-7dc0-94f9-88243750e07e",
  "startsAt": "2026-09-28T10:00:00+05:00",
  "note": "First booking test"
}

### My bookings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

@bookingId = 01a0c930-3e2e-7482-b795-17fd841fc6b2

### Professional: list bookings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pro/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Professional: confirm booking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pro/bookings/{{bookingId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Professional: decline booking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pro/bookings/{{bookingId}}/decline
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Professional: complete booking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pro/bookings/{{bookingId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Professional: mark no-show
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pro/bookings/{{bookingId}}/no-show
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Professional: cancel booking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pro/bookings/{{bookingId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create booking for overlap test
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serviceId": "01a0c82b-8334-7dc0-94f9-88243750e07e",
  "startsAt": "2026-09-29T10:00:00+05:00",
  "note": "Overlap protection test"
}

@completedBookingId = 01a0c91b-b95e-73b4-bcf5-122d0165ac5f
@professionalId = 01a0c7ea-0ab7-7b59-8920-40b39bbc6b87

### Create review for completed booking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bookings/{{completedBookingId}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Excellent service and very professional."
}

### Public: professional reviews
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/professionals/{{professionalId}}/reviews

### Add professional to favorites
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/favorites/{{professionalId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### My favorites
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Remove professional from favorites
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/favorites/{{professionalId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Professional dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pro/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### My notifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Notification unread count
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/notifications/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mark all notifications read
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}